{
  "name": "DevSynt Hiring - 2. Review & Routing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky_overview2",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, -60],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Workflow 2 — Review & Routing\n\n**Flow:**\n1. On a schedule, read pending scored candidates from Supabase (status = pending_review, classification already set by Workflow 1)\n2. Branch on classification:\n   - Strong -> HTML shortlist/confirmation email -> status = notified\n   - Average -> notify hiring manager -> status = manual_review\n   - Weak -> rejection email -> status = notified\n3. Update the record's status after each action so it's never processed twice\n\n**Before running:**\n- Attach Supabase and SMTP/Email credentials on the placeholder nodes.\n- Set the hiring manager's email address in the 'Notify Hiring Manager' node.\n- Adjust the schedule interval to your preference."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "schedule_trigger",
      "name": "Every 15 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-200, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            { "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 15 }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "get_pending",
      "name": "Get Pending Candidates (Supabase)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [40, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "candidates",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "pending_review"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Only pulls candidates not yet acted on. Workflow 1 leaves status='pending_review' after scoring."
    },
    {
      "id": "has_classification",
      "name": "Has Classification?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{$json.classification}}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Error handling: skip records where AI scoring hasn't completed yet (classification still null) - they'll be picked up next run"
    },
    {
      "id": "switch_classification",
      "name": "Route by Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "expression",
        "output": "={{$json.classification}}",
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        },
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            { "outputKey": "Strong" },
            { "outputKey": "Average" },
            { "outputKey": "Weak" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send_strong_email",
      "name": "Send Shortlist Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [740, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "careers@devsynt.com",
        "toEmail": "={{$json.email}}",
        "subject": "Great news about your DevSynt application!",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<p>Hi {{$json.name}},</p><p>Congratulations! Your application for the <strong>{{$json.role_applied}}</strong> role has passed our initial screening. Our team will reach out shortly to schedule the next step in the process.</p><p>— The DevSynt Hiring Team</p>"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "DevSynt SMTP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notify_manager_email",
      "name": "Notify Hiring Manager",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [740, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "careers@devsynt.com",
        "toEmail": "hiring.manager@devsynt.com",
        "subject": "Manual review needed: {{$json.name}} - {{$json.role_applied}}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<p>A candidate needs manual review:</p><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> {{$json.name}}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> {{$json.email}}</li><li><strong>Role:</strong> {{$json.role_applied}}</li><li><strong>ATS Score:</strong> {{$json.ats_score}}</li><li><strong>Source:</strong> {{$json.source}}</li></ul><p>Resume/notes: {{$json.resume_text}}</p><p>Please review in Supabase and add manager_notes.</p>"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "DevSynt SMTP"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Replace hiring.manager@devsynt.com with the real hiring manager address"
    },
    {
      "id": "send_weak_email",
      "name": "Send Rejection Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [740, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "careers@devsynt.com",
        "toEmail": "={{$json.email}}",
        "subject": "Update on your DevSynt application",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "<p>Hi {{$json.name}},</p><p>Thank you for taking the time to apply for the <strong>{{$json.role_applied}}</strong> role at DevSynt. After careful review, we've decided not to move forward with your application at this time.</p><p>We appreciate your interest in DevSynt and encourage you to apply again in the future.</p><p>— The DevSynt Hiring Team</p>"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "DevSynt SMTP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update_status_strong",
      "name": "Update Status - Notified (Strong)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "candidates",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchingColumns": ["email"],
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "notified" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update_status_average",
      "name": "Update Status - Manual Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "candidates",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchingColumns": ["email"],
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "manual_review" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update_status_weak",
      "name": "Update Status - Notified (Weak)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "candidates",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchingColumns": ["email"],
        "dataToSend": "defineBelow",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            { "fieldId": "status", "fieldValue": "notified" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Supabase account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 15 Minutes": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Get Pending Candidates (Supabase)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Get Pending Candidates (Supabase)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Has Classification?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Has Classification?": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Route by Classification", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Route by Classification": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Shortlist Email", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
